11.enum
Enum is used to define a fixed set of named constant values. It makes the code more readable and helps restrict values to predefined options.

exmaple
enum Role {
    Admin = "ADMIN",
    Manager = "MANAGER",
    Employee = "EMPLOYEE"
}

function checkRole(role: Role) {
    if (role === Role.Admin) {
        console.log("Admin user");
    }
}

checkRole(Role.Admin);

